+# Part 2 image asset requirements
+
+The supplied screenshots contain repeated images. Store each distinct high-quality
+source once, under the matching `public/images/` directory. Use lossless masters
+outside the repository and optimized WebP/AVIF for the site.
+
+## Hero assets
+
+- `food/home-hero`: cappuccino with latte art, cheeseburger and fries,
+  vegetable pizza, brownie/ice cream. Wide horizontal editorial layout.
+- `food/about-hero`: pizza with lifted cheese slice in warm kitchen lighting.
+- `food/gallery-hero`: burger, fries, tall chocolate beverage.
+- `food/contact-hero`: latte, brownies, café table with flowers.
+- `events/party-hero`: decorated café birthday seating with warm lighting.
+- `interiors/table-booking-hero`: reserved table with flowers/candle and café background.
+- `food/cart-hero`: combined coffee, burger, pizza and brownie composition.
+- `food/checkout-hero`: burger and fries with negative space for left-side title.
+
+## Food and drink subjects
+
+Cappuccino / latte art, veg burger, cheese pizza / cheese-pull pizza, grilled
+sandwich, brownie with ice cream, pasta, momos, paneer curry, fries,
+chocolate shake, blue lemonade, strawberry shake, cheese cake, chocolate cake.
+
+## Venue photos
+
+Restaurant façade, main dining area, plant-filled lounge, warm pendant
+lighting, party seating, birthday decor, family gathering tables.
+
+## Quality floor
+
+- Hero: ideally 2400 px or wider after the intended crop.
+- Product card: ideally 1000 px or wider, consistent orientation.
+- Never introduce visible fake names, signage or unsupported facility claims.
+- Use consistent warm cinematic lighting without heavy artificial sharpening.
+- Add informative alt text once photos are finalized.
